    "user": "U08CR7HUWDC",
    "text": "hey \u003c@U0CA4S2GS4B\u003e,\nWe already store state in Iceberg metadata. `state.json` is a leftover from earlier versions, when we kept state only in that file, and we haven't fully removed it yet. We're tracking that here: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake/issues/1251|github.com/datazip-inc/olake/issues/1251\u003e\nHow are you running OLake: Helm, Docker, or just the CLI?",
